        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: High Rollers Casino\n- Companies: Cinemaware, Virtual Toys\n- Platforms: PlayStation 2, Xbox\n- Topics: Casino games, gambling simulation, entertainment uses\n\nFacts:\n- High Rollers Casino is a 2004 casino video game.\n- Cinemaware and Virtual Toys co-developed High Rollers Casino.\n- High Rollers Casino was released for the PlayStation 2 and Xbox consoles.\n- Casino games can be played outside casinos for entertainment purposes such as parties and school competitions.\n- Some casino games outside casinos are played on machines that simulate gambling.",
